{"requirements": [
    {
        "id": 1,
        "text": "The goal of the game is to grow the length of the snake by making the snake eat food until it fills the entire board."
    },
    {
        "id": 2,
        "text": "The snake eats food when it touches the food (namely every time the snake passes over food on the board)."
    },
    {
        "id": 3,
        "text": "Every time the snake eats a piece of food, its body grows by one block which gets attached to the end of the body."
    },
    {
        "id": 4,
        "text": "The snake must not touch a board side."
    },
    {
        "id": 5,
        "text": "The game is over as soon as the snake's body is touched."
    },
    {
        "id": 6,
        "text": "The game board consists of k x k blocks, where k shall be given as input by the user. Every block, including the food and body blocks of the snake, shall have a size such that there are enough blocks to play the game correctly."
    },
    {
        "id": 7,
        "text": "When the game starts, the board is initialised with a snake and a piece of food. It shall be represented as a single green block, positioned at the bottom left square of the board. The initial direction shall be up."
    },
    {
        "id": 8,
        "text": "The snake could be moved by pressing up, down, right, or left on the keyboard."
    },
    {
        "id": 9,
        "text": "Every time the snake eats a piece of food,  a new one shall appear."
    },
    {
        "id": 10,
        "text": "Every time the snake eats a piece of food, its speed increases by 10 milliseconds."
    },
    {
        "id": 11,
        "text": "The user can set the difficulty to easy or hard. If the user selects “easy”, the snake initially moves with a speed of 0.5 blocks per second."
    },
    {
        "id": 12,
        "text": "After the snake has eaten many pieces of food, a blue bonus piece of food should appear. When the snake eats that piece, three blocks shall be attached to the snake's body."
    },
    {
        "id": 13,
        "text": "Sometimes, a golden bonus block shall appear additionally to the food block. If the snake eats the bonus block, the speed shall decrease by 5%."
    },
    {
        "id": 14,
        "text": "If the user presses p on the keyboard, the game shall pause until the user presses q again."
    }
]}
